# Build context for devops/docker/Dockerfile: Cargo manifests, .cargo/, crates/, proto/,
# plus what the chaos image ships at runtime (configs/, scenarios/, topologies/, the built UI).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!.cargo/
!crates/
!proto/
!configs/
!scenarios/
!topologies/
!ui/chaos/out/
# never ship build output or secrets even if the allowlist above matches a subpath
**/target/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
